# User-authorized, separately attributed CC BY 4.0 curated motions; originals stay in .local.
!assets/bundled/100style/100style-idles/*/motions/idle/*.vmd
!assets/bundled/mpi-embm/mpi-embm-gestures/*/motions/gesture/*.vmd
